                        "glosses": [
                            "A room or display of prizes to be won at a competition (especially non-cash ones)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Switzerland",
                            "masculine",
                            "strong"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bac7dd6-e04c-452f-bc29-b2ecf662198a",
                                "sense_id": "c7493537-e655-3909-ae84-517115cb2284",
                                "text": "Auch die anderen Teilnehmer in Burgdorf gehen nicht leer aus. Für sie steht der Gabentempel bereit, eine riesige Halle, gefüllt mit Waschmaschinen und Gefriertruhen, Mountainbikes und Motorrädern, Möbeln und Gemälden, Werkzeug und Elektrogeräten und was man sich sonst noch so wünscht.",
                                "translation": "The other competitors in Burgdorf won't be leaving empty-handed either. The room of gifts awaits them, a massive hall, filled with washing mashines and freezers, mountain bikes and motorcycles, furniture and paintings tools and electric appliances and whatever else one might wish for.",
                                "english": "The other competitors in Burgdorf won't be leaving empty-handed either. The room of gifts awaits them, a massive hall, filled with washing mashines and freezers, mountain bikes and motorcycles, furniture and paintings tools and electric appliances and whatever else one might wish for."
                            }
                        ]
